You can create a moving square using HTML and CSS by copying and pasting the code below into a .html file, then uploading it to your website.
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <style>
    .square {
        display: inline-block;
        height: 100px;
        width: 100px;
        background: #ccc;
        position: relative;
        animation: move 1s linear infinite;
    }
    @keyframes move {
       100% {
            transform: translate(-100%, 0);
        }
    }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="square"></div>
</body>
</html>

